1587 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Browsing the internet is seeing the world through the lenses of glasses that aren\047t yours\056 The algorithm decides what you see and what is kept from you\056 Your information is gathered and sold like an auction shop to marketing agencies\056 Everywhere now require log ins\054 cookies and tracking data\056\015\n\015\nAuth\056be opposes all that today\047s internet stands for\056 The surveillance\054 the data harvesting\056 The website displays a free user\055generated feed of random photos updated daily that are 100\045 unfiltered\054 unmodified and fully autonomous\056 Meant for artists looking to share their works and everyday people sick of AI\055slop and never\055ending doom scroll\054 Auth\056be offers a fresh feed clean of any manipulation tactics or polarization\056 )
